    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the history of its existence, no one has ever returned from Axom alive. Armed with cutting-edge tech and unbreakable will, you intend to be the first to discover the secrets of the planet.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEFEND AGAINST THE ENDLESS SWARMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Axom: Conquest\u00a0</strong>is a base building roguelite tower defense game set on the dangerous planet named Axom fighting against thousands of aliens who are very keen on you not being there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5a0a3a7baf62e29ff25f558faefe3664.poster.avif?t=1748907924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5a0a3a7baf62e29ff25f558faefe3664.webm?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5a0a3a7baf62e29ff25f558faefe3664.mp4?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources to build defences, unlock research between games to get stronger, discover insane upgrades and synergies and survive wave after wave of increasingly angrier aliens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/d39890a171bd3bd778f8c109f1b9edac.avif?t=1748907924\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinitely repayable procedurally generated levels - Each mission is different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your base - Construct towers, walls and hazards to defend your all important Nexus Drill from the hoards of Centurax trying to destroy it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wave based combat - Prepare and build in advance, then start the Nexus Drill, alerting all enemies in the area. Each wave the challenge grows stronger until you are ultimately defeated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources - Gather from the ground, build refineries on resource nodes scattered around the map, but defend them well to keep your income stream safe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades Upgrades Upgrades! - Discover hundreds of unique upgrades from bouncy walls to nuclear arms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every game you get stronger - Collect research while in game to complete research aboard your ship which provide permanent advantages for each subsequent game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of structures - Dozens of structures to build, including branching paths for different structure variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mouse only Support - Axom: Conquest is fully playable with only use of the mouse, with the keyboard providing shortcuts for certain actions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INFECTED GROUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle against the planet itself as it comes to destroy you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/e73e41cfb157fab97db9e1aa31cb0e62.poster.avif?t=1748907924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/e73e41cfb157fab97db9e1aa31cb0e62.webm?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/e73e41cfb157fab97db9e1aa31cb0e62.mp4?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD YOUR PERFECT DEFENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deploy dozens of towers and hundreds of upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/ba39cabef838a6f79e0b1f239c607330.poster.avif?t=1748907924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/ba39cabef838a6f79e0b1f239c607330.webm?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/ba39cabef838a6f79e0b1f239c607330.mp4?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9a395e872cb1656201e1597af17ea1ca.avif?t=1748907924\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the depths of space lies Axom, a planet overflowing with resources, a treasure trove for any daring enough to claim it. But you\u2019re not the first to try.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You are an independent miner with your heart set on riches.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Standing between you and those untold riches is the Centurax, a relentless alien force guarding their world with unending ferocity. Alone, you\u2019ll face wave after wave, fighting for survival as you strip the planet of its bounty. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Yet as you dig deeper, the true purpose behind the Centurax\u2019s defence begins to emerge, revealing a mystery buried in the planet\u2019s core. </i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the history of its existence, no one has ever returned from Axom alive. Armed with cutting-edge tech and unbreakable will, you intend to be the first to discover the secrets of the planet.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEFEND AGAINST THE ENDLESS SWARMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Axom: Conquest\u00a0</strong>is a base building roguelite tower defense game set on the dangerous planet named Axom fighting against thousands of aliens who are very keen on you not being there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5a0a3a7baf62e29ff25f558faefe3664.poster.avif?t=1748907924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5a0a3a7baf62e29ff25f558faefe3664.webm?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5a0a3a7baf62e29ff25f558faefe3664.mp4?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources to build defences, unlock research between games to get stronger, discover insane upgrades and synergies and survive wave after wave of increasingly angrier aliens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/d39890a171bd3bd778f8c109f1b9edac.avif?t=1748907924\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinitely repayable procedurally generated levels - Each mission is different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your base - Construct towers, walls and hazards to defend your all important Nexus Drill from the hoards of Centurax trying to destroy it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wave based combat - Prepare and build in advance, then start the Nexus Drill, alerting all enemies in the area. Each wave the challenge grows stronger until you are ultimately defeated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources - Gather from the ground, build refineries on resource nodes scattered around the map, but defend them well to keep your income stream safe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades Upgrades Upgrades! - Discover hundreds of unique upgrades from bouncy walls to nuclear arms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every game you get stronger - Collect research while in game to complete research aboard your ship which provide permanent advantages for each subsequent game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of structures - Dozens of structures to build, including branching paths for different structure variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mouse only Support - Axom: Conquest is fully playable with only use of the mouse, with the keyboard providing shortcuts for certain actions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INFECTED GROUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle against the planet itself as it comes to destroy you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/e73e41cfb157fab97db9e1aa31cb0e62.poster.avif?t=1748907924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/e73e41cfb157fab97db9e1aa31cb0e62.webm?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/e73e41cfb157fab97db9e1aa31cb0e62.mp4?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD YOUR PERFECT DEFENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deploy dozens of towers and hundreds of upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/ba39cabef838a6f79e0b1f239c607330.poster.avif?t=1748907924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/ba39cabef838a6f79e0b1f239c607330.webm?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/ba39cabef838a6f79e0b1f239c607330.mp4?t=1748907924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9a395e872cb1656201e1597af17ea1ca.avif?t=1748907924\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the depths of space lies Axom, a planet overflowing with resources, a treasure trove for any daring enough to claim it. But you\u2019re not the first to try.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You are an independent miner with your heart set on riches.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Standing between you and those untold riches is the Centurax, a relentless alien force guarding their world with unending ferocity. Alone, you\u2019ll face wave after wave, fighting for survival as you strip the planet of its bounty. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Yet as you dig deeper, the true purpose behind the Centurax\u2019s defence begins to emerge, revealing a mystery buried in the planet\u2019s core. </i></p>",
